fraudPrevention.check.clientPublicIps.problem = Distinct Gov-Client-Public-IP values found: {0}. At least {1} are needed to show testing on different networks.
fraudPrevention.check.clientPublicIps.values = Gov-Client-Public-IP values
fraudPrevention.check.deviceIds.name = Different devices (Gov-Client-Device-ID)
fraudPrevention.check.deviceIds.found = {0} distinct, at least {1} needed
fraudPrevention.check.deviceIds.problem = Distinct Gov-Client-Device-ID values found: {0}. At least {1} are needed to show testing on different devices.
fraudPrevention.check.deviceIds.values = Gov-Client-Device-ID values
fraudPrevention.check.localIps.name = Different local networks (Gov-Client-Local-IPs)
fraudPrevention.check.localIps.found = {0} distinct, at least {1} needed
