import.title = Import logs
import.heading = Import logs
import.intro = Paste log lines or upload a log file in the HMRC API platform logback format. Lines that cannot be parsed are kept and flagged.
import.paste.label = Paste log lines
import.paste.hint = One log line per row, in the vat-api logback format with optional appId and clientId fields, and optional fraud prevention header fields (govClientPublicIP, govVendorPublicIP, govClientDeviceID, govClientLocalIPs, govVendorLicenseIDs).
import.paste.button = Import pasted lines
import.upload.heading = Or upload a log file
import.upload.label = Upload a file
import.upload.hint = .log or .txt, up to 20MB
import.upload.button = Import file
import.error.emptyPaste = Enter at least one log line to import
import.error.noFile = Select a log file to import
import.error.fileType = The selected file must be a .log or .txt file
import.error.tooLarge = The selected file must be smaller than 20MB
import.success.heading = Import complete
import.success.detail = {0} lines read, {1} parsed, {2} could not be parsed.
import.success.unparsedSamples = First unparsed lines:

